	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n_qzk0Byb8bqaYy9D",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 3, DX 14, IQ 5, HT 11, HP 3, WILL 9, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n__aCSXVieRweKXSa",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 3, protection -4), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6dny5wcAhQlEZFSc",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/cat.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nAmPnumRug3y1oAqD",
			"text": "Independent build total: -45 points of racial traits plus 26 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n253AIT4HYk_NuupP",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Cat (SRD 5.1); Cat (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n0Qfat25oORS3QMUW",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7a3XoyIyDmRbXVGg",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "n8P6ZOzRB0cfuE56q",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
